  "texts": {
    "preamble": "Raghava Reddy vs The State Of Andhra Pradesh, on 20 August, 2020 Author: K. Suresh Reddy Bench: K. Suresh Reddy The Hon'Ble Sri Justice K. Suresh Reddy Criminal Petition No.3285 Of 2020 Order:",
    "facts": "This is a Criminal Petition is filed by the petitioner under Section 482 of the Code of Criminal Procedure to quash the proceedings against the petitioner, in FIR No.203 of 2020, dated 12.05.2020, on the file of Kurnool Taluka Police Station, Kurnool District. The offences alleged are under Sections 188, 273, 328 of IPC and Section 59(i) of Food Safety and Standards Act, 2006.",
    "arguments": "2. Counsel for the petitioner has places reliance on the common order dated 18.12.2019 passed by a coordinate Bench of this Court in Criminal Petition Nos.5421 of 2019 and batch, holding that \"tobacco\" does not fall within the definition of \"food\", as specified under Section 3(i)(j) of the Act, therefore, registration of FIR is not permissible.",
    "petitioner_arguments": "2. Counsel for the petitioner has places reliance on the common order dated 18.12.2019 passed by a coordinate Bench of this Court in Criminal Petition Nos.5421 of 2019 and batch, holding that \"tobacco\" does not fall within the definition of \"food\", as specified under Section 3(i)(j) of the Act, therefore, registration of FIR is not permissible.",
